WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
People still live comfortably

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,400
The greater the ability, the greater the responsibility

3
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:06,800
How can my small business be compared to Brother Wang? My friend is going to entertain someone.

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,200
Do you still have the boss who brought me here?

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,120
Good stuff like Imperial Pork

6
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:12,710
What a bad luck this time

7
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:17,170
The previous items have been sold out, but

8
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:20,860
Words that lead to the boss

9
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:29,020
Why don't you try this beer? I'm the only one with happy beer. I have thirty yuan a bottle here. Are you serious?

10
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:31,010
Boss Jin’s net worth is high

11
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:32,090
I spent several months on the relationship

12
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:34,810
I just invited people over for the first meal and you asked me to treat them to a drink

13
00:00:34,810 --> 00:00:35,930
Thirty bucks for beer

14
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,330
It's different from ordinary beer

15
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:38,810
After drinking it, I won’t eat it no matter how much I comment on it.

16
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,020
Drink it slowly by yourself

17
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,260
A beer blower
